Tier 3 + enhancement sweep: dead code, tests, partial monolith split

Dead code / data integrity:
  - Remove server/jobs/snapshot-scheduler.ts (no-op) and its API endpoints
  - Remove unused client/src/components/examples/
  - Drop deprecated users.password column (migration 0012)
  - Add missing FK constraints via NOT VALID (migration 0013) for
    user_votes, community_insights, celebrity_profiles, credit_ledger,
    comment_reports

Observability / security:
  - pino structured logging + request-id middleware (server/log.ts)
  - Optional Sentry integration (server/sentry.ts), wired into error
    handlers and uncaught/unhandled hooks
  - Hard-gate GDELT_RELAX_SSL in production unless GDELT_RELAX_SSL_FORCE
  - Dedicated admin rate-limit bucket (higher ceiling than user writes)
  - .env.example documenting every env var grouped by concern

Perf / correctness:
  - hot-movers snapshot query uses DISTINCT ON (person_id) to avoid
    client-side dedupe
  - Strongly-typed _cachedHotMovers (no more any)
  - Shared parseVoteError utility; applied to VotePage, PersonDetail,
    AnimatedSentimentVotingWidget

Testing:
  - New unit tests for scoring engine: normalize, trendScore, utils
    (40 new tests, 77/77 suite passing)

Monolith partial split:
  - server/routes.ts: gamification-read and favorites-CRUD extracted
    into server/route-modules/{gamification,favorites}-routes.ts
  - client/src/pages/AdminDashboard.tsx: types, auth helpers,
    SettleMarketModal, CopyDebugSummaryButton extracted into
    client/src/pages/admin/

Deferred: UserLeaderboardPage virtualization - current PAGE_SIZE=25 +
Load More pattern doesn't warrant it; revisit if we switch to
auto-scrolling infinite mode.
